 "decision": "Semantic action-text targets beat the matched index-target control decisively at the early-stopped checkpoint: dev57 top-1 0.614 vs 0.509, mean visit-share regret 0.143 vs 0.183 (clean 0.141 vs 0.198), top-set 0.667 vs 0.579, legacy-view 36/57 vs 28/57 (first artifact past the historical 32/57 gate). Improvement exceeds the preregistered promising bar on both splits; single seed, so status is promising-replicate, not confirmed. turn_plan is weaker on first-action choice (best 0.526/0.162) but generates 100% legal plans; treat as secondary. Next: replicate action_text with training seeds 1/2; then the +combat_public_v3 prompt arm; then visit_sampled soft targets; then a behavior calibration run on train windows.",
